WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.375
Every decision here has one owner.

2
00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:05.043
The Chief AI Officer requires every live

3
00:00:05.043 --> 00:00:08.025
inventory entry to link
to an identity record.

4
00:00:08.025 --> 00:00:10.642
The identity governance officer makes sure

5
00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:13.400
that record exists before
any credential does.

6
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.854
The CISO sets the credential,
policy and logging rules,

7
00:00:16.854 --> 00:00:19.632
the system owner decides
what an AI may reach,

8
00:00:19.632 --> 00:00:24.363
and the authorizing official decides
when a change needs reauthorization.

9
00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:29.538
And you can start Monday without buying
anything: list your agents and their owners,

10
00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:33.363
scan your own inventory, build
the block policy in report-only,

11
00:00:33.363 --> 00:00:36.813
export your logs, and tailor
service authentication in.

12
00:00:36.813 --> 00:00:38.987
An agent that acts is an account.

13
00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:40.762
Give it an owner and an end.

14
00:00:40.762 --> 00:00:41.590
Thank you.
